{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 Puzzle Temptation: Anime Reveal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take a break. Clear your mind. Reveal the beauty beneath.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Puzzle Temptation: Anime Reveal</i> is a calm and satisfying puzzle experience designed for short play sessions and long chill vibes. Instead of placing pieces, you\u2019ll reveal hidden anime art by tapping rotating circles to shoot and clear colored puzzle tiles. Every hit uncovers more of the artwork underneath, a new outfit, a new pose, a new moment of temptation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no timer, no pressure, and no stress. Just a relaxing atmosphere, soft music, and stunning anime illustrations waiting to be revealed at your pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Click to fire and watch tiles fade away as images are slowly uncovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful Anime Art</strong> \u2013 Unlock dozens of unique illustrations with various outfits and themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Pressure</strong> \u2013 No time limits, no score, just pure visual satisfaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallery Mode</strong> \u2013 Revisit any unlocked artwork at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-Hand Friendly</strong> \u2013 Simple, click-based gameplay ideal for winding down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re between study sessions, taking a break from work, or just want to chill with something visually rewarding, <i>Puzzle Temptation: Anime Reveal</i> offers a satisfying escape.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Complete base game level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3802900/f6d98bc6ba73137d26215f28ea9c4324b640fd9a.jpg"},{"name":"Complete b